WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.260
Friday night.

2
00:00:01.310 --> 00:00:02.520
Trains run.

3
00:00:02.570 --> 00:00:04.600
Newspapers print rumours.

4
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:07.090
People sit down to dinner as usual.

5
00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:11.600
The narrator notices "the dovetailing
of the commonplace habits of our social

6
00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:14.500
order", even with Martians nearby.

7
00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:17.380
Then the clock spins on to Monday.

8
00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:20.450
So when the Martians
come, what breaks first:

9
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.450
buildings, or people?

10
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.860
In this mission, you'll see how
long ordinary routine carries on.

11
00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:30.890
You'll stand in London as Monday
dawns, and read what happens next,

12
00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:32.370
line by line.

13
00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:35.320
And you'll meet people
under pressure: a curate,

14
00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:38.990
a man with a bag of gold,
a woman with a pony cart.

15
00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:41.960
Your mission: work out what breaks first,

16
00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:43.560
buildings or people.
